contentText:
When Freya Skye first performed &#8220;Bad Taste&#8221; at her debut headlining show in New York in December 2025, she wasn&#8217;t sure the song would ever leave the scene of the stage.

The then-unreleased track was stripped back to just Skye and her guitarist, Donnie. &#8220;I remember being terrified,&#8221; Skye tells Billboard . &#8220;It was my first ever headline show I&#8217;d ever done, and I was in New York &#8230; It was quite exposed and vulnerable.&#8221;

